# =============================================================================
# Live deployment addresses on the Hyperledger Besu QBFT L1 (chain 1337).
#
# Deterministic from deployer 0xf39F (anvil[0]) + sequential nonces under
# DeployL1.s.sol's deploy order:
#   nonce 0  →  Registry           0x5FbDB231…
#   nonce 1  →  Verifier           0xe7f1725E…
#   nonce 2  →  CommandLog         0x9fE46736…  
#   nonce 3  →  Registry.setVerifier (call, no new contract)
# Stable across re-deploys on a clean Besu chain.
# =============================================================================

# ── Chain ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
export URL=http://localhost:8545
export CHAIN_ID=1337

